                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfDispatchUserCtrlBusOffUL</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the upper layer (UL) module to which the notifications of all ControllerBusOff events from the CAN Driver modules have to be routed via &lt;User_ControllerBusOff>.</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">There is no possibility to configure no upper layer (UL) module as the provider of &lt;User_ControllerBusOff>.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
