                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidDynamicallyDefined</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Indicates if this DID can be dynamically defined</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">true = DID can be dynamically defined
                                                        false = DID can not be dynamically defined</L-1>
