                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidRangeHasGaps</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Parameter specifying if there are gaps in the DID range (parameter set to TRUE) or not (parameter set to FALSE)</L-2>
                              </DESC>
