                      <SHORT-NAME>DemFreezeFrameCapture</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the point in time, when the freeze frame data collection is done for the initial event memory entry.</L-2>
                      </DESC>
