                              <SHORT-NAME>FrCycleRepetition</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">FIFO cylce counter acceptance criteria. Valid values are  1,2,4,5,8,10,16,20,32,40,50,64.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
