                          <SHORT-NAME>FrNmVotingNextToLastRepetitionCycleDisable</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Pre-processor switch for disabling vote changes in the last two</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
