                          <SHORT-NAME>J1939TpTxDtNPdu</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This N-PDU represents the TP.DT frame of a J1939 transport protocol session. TP.DT is used both by BAM and CMDT to transfer the contents of an N-SDU.</L-2>
