                        <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the relationship between the AtomicSwComponentType's NVRAMMapping / NVRAM needs and the NvM module configuration.</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
